WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
EGoli, bheka udonga olufanayo olungamamitha amabili emini.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Phakathi nehlobo ilanga lifinyelela ku-87°. Umthunzi wodonga mfushane.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Lapho kusondela ubusika, ilanga liba phansi emini. Umthunzi uba mude ubheke eningizimu.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Phakathi nobusika ilanga liku-40°. Umthunzi ucishe ube ngu-2.4 m ubude.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Lapha ebusika umthunzi uya kwesokudla, eningizimu. Kwesobunxele, enyakatho, kunelanga.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Tshala izitshalo ezimfushane ohlangothini olusenyakatho lodonga olude.
